{"server":"cn","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_03_beg","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_03","title":"意外之旅","storyCode":"GT-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"5637e827e286a82b5a49a563c236769c021f1260397912f52779f2b196538419","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，你把我的同伴，全干掉了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......别、别过来啊！求你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我把金币都给你！我把我的武器给你！你要什么我都——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个女孩子在哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么——？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别靠近我——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你这个——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"晴 \\ 能见度 14公里\n塔拉特山前森林"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"......这块石头......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你们两个，跟上。小心脚底，跟着我的脚印走，手也不要到处摸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"这片森林，恐怕比你我想的还要危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"石头上是不是刻了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"这是赏金猎人留下的符号。不按照符号指示行动的话，就会踩进设置好的陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要直接躲开陷阱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"看我的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"——绊索加捕兽夹，老土的小把戏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"树丛恰好挡住了摆锤，一旦贸然前进就会被击中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那里，可萝尔小姐，小心点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你再向前走一步，大概就会掉进满是尖头的深坑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是赏金猎人，很擅长这些嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然，毕竟我以前——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"想要绕开陷阱是不现实的。果然，还是要全部解除掉才方便行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟他们最危险的道路，马上就会变成对我们来说最安全的那种了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"不太对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"是陷阱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"沾血的符号......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"“——怪物？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"这什么意思？这么多年来，我都没见过有人用过这个符号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不会吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怪物，怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别，别过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是你啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，你是斯卡蒂，没错吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——原来滴水村村长是和你在一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，什么？你认识可萝尔....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"把她交给我。现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼，她的眼神，不太对啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行，我们应该谈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"呜啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不，可萝尔小姐，鲍勃大叔....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"她，她怎么会攻击你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是认识她，她怎么就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"别问那么多了！快，快跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈，她还在追着我们跑吗？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格，格拉尼，我，我跑不动了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那个女人，真的，是怪物吧？她甚至，都没在喘气啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我要陪你们浪费时间？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"她真的要砍了我，啊不，她要拿可萝尔小姐干什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"她的眼睛，好，好红.....格，格拉尼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不行了不行了，为什么还会有这种事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"停！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"埋伏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是现在！放箭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"就是她，那个突袭我们的灾星！快，快射她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你们给我住手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子想干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道为什么她要追我，但好歹也是我的同事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"为、为什么要坏我的事！混账——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"趁现在，快点走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"——向东突围！走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"别想逃出去！受死吧怪物！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈尔语）滚开!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["？？？","斯卡蒂"]}]}
